17ecec1" class="r-z1ylzz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>While you can certainly take monthlies powder for its potential benefits, it's important to note that hormonal contraceptives, such as implants and pills, can affect hormone levels.  </p><br><p>Since hormonal contraceptives regulate your hormone balance, the efficacy of the powder might be compromised by the contraceptive method you are using.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-begin{%- endcomment -%}<!-- -->{% assign product = reploOriginalProductR6e32 %}<!-- -->{% assign reploSelectedVariant = reploOriginalProductVariantR6e32 %}<!-- -->{% assign reploSortedSellingPlans = reploOriginalSPGR6e32 %}<!-- -->{% assign reploSelectedSellingPlan = reploOriginalSSPR6e32 %}<!-- -->{% assign reploSelectedSellingPlanPrice = reploOriginalSSPPriceR6e32 %}<!-- -->{% assign reploCompareAtPriceDifferencePercentage = reploOriginalComparePricePercentR6e32 %}<!-- -->{%- comment -%}replo-liquid-chunk-end{%- endcomment -%}</div></div></div><div data-replo-marquee-root="true" data-rid="dbed2e2b-dc5d-4172-8f66-5e4399737b57" class="r-1m9wers"><div class="r-1b0pl9u" data-replo-marquee-track="true"><div data-rid="c120ebf3-1566-4028-97d5-4d11b79ac535" class="r-1cqj72p"><div data-rid="45c36e5d-3516-4c08-9a95-a8f8310c2d1c" class="r-1bnztku"><picture data-rid="b4dd33db-39b1-48ae-a22b-4b0fa4825f5d" class="r-19mgn09"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0708/7462/8371/files/360_support.png?v=1737212396&amp;width=96" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0708/7462/8371/files/360_support.png?v=1737212396&amp;width=96" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0708/7462/8371/files/360_support.png?v=1737212396&amp;width=96" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/070